            "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Full-bleed portrait 4:5 production puzzle painting, warm richly detailed oil/gouache storybook realism with subtle brush texture, coherent anatomy and perspective, no text, numerals, brands, famous places, border or UI. Complete natural scene, not a diagram. This clean plate will receive five small hand-painted animated objects later. Draw natural attachment surfaces but omit only the stated small details. Eye-level intimate view of a postcard-writing table with large CORAL PINK linen covering and softly coral wall, blank cream illustrated cards featuring only simple floral paintings, an open envelope, ink bottle, wooden pen, wax seal tools, travel journal, window to garden. No writing anywhere on paper. Provide a tiny empty ivory bud vase at right; a blank envelope in center with no loose petal on it; journal with one bare string knot; an empty short pin/hook on rear wooden rail; and a short bare plant stem in small pot left. Later details flower, loose tiny petal, string bow, hanging small feather charm, leaf sprig. Natural coherent tabletop shadows.",
